{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":1,"id":"function-metahelper","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Function: metaHelper()"}]},{"type":"code","value":"function metaHelper<TMeta>(): TMeta;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/helpers/metaHelper.ts#L22","children":[{"type":"text","value":"helpers/metaHelper.ts:22"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A helper for declaring the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"tableMeta"},{"type":"text","value":"/"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"columnMeta"},{"type":"text","value":" type-only slots in the\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"features"},{"type":"text","value":" option without a type assertion."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Equivalent to "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"{} as TMeta"},{"type":"text","value":", but reads as type-only at the call site and\navoids "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@typescript-eslint/no-unnecessary-type-assertion"},{"type":"text","value":" false positives\nwhen the meta type has only optional properties (where an auto-fix removing\nthe assertion would silently degrade the inferred meta type to "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"{}"},{"type":"text","value":")."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The returned value is a phantom — it is ignored and stripped from the\ntable's registered features at runtime; only its type is used."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tmeta","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TMeta"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TMeta"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"object"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TMeta"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { metaHelper, tableFeatures, rowSortingFeature } from '@tanstack/react-table'\nconst features = tableFeatures({\n  rowSortingFeature,\n  tableMeta: metaHelper<MyTableMeta>(),\n  columnMeta: metaHelper<MyColumnMeta>(),\n});"}],"headings":[{"id":"function-metahelper","text":"Function: metaHelper()","level":1},{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tmeta","text":"TMeta","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n# Function: metaHelper()\n\n```ts\nfunction metaHelper<TMeta>(): TMeta;\n```\n\nDefined in: [helpers/metaHelper.ts:22](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/helpers/metaHelper.ts#L22)\n\nA helper for declaring the `tableMeta`/`columnMeta` type-only slots in the\n`features` option without a type assertion.\n\nEquivalent to `{} as TMeta`, but reads as type-only at the call site and\navoids `@typescript-eslint/no-unnecessary-type-assertion` false positives\nwhen the meta type has only optional properties (where an auto-fix removing\nthe assertion would silently degrade the inferred meta type to `{}`).\n\nThe returned value is a phantom — it is ignored and stripped from the\ntable's registered features at runtime; only its type is used.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TMeta\n\n`TMeta` *extends* `object`\n\n## Returns\n\n`TMeta`\n\n## Example\n\n```\nimport { metaHelper, tableFeatures, rowSortingFeature } from '@tanstack/react-table'\nconst features = tableFeatures({\n  rowSortingFeature,\n  tableMeta: metaHelper<MyTableMeta>(),\n  columnMeta: metaHelper<MyColumnMeta>(),\n});\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: metaHelper\ntitle: metaHelper\n---\n\n# Function: metaHelper()\n\n```ts\nfunction metaHelper<TMeta>(): TMeta;\n```\n\nDefined in: [helpers/metaHelper.ts:22](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/helpers/metaHelper.ts#L22)\n\nA helper for declaring the `tableMeta`/`columnMeta` type-only slots in the\n`features` option without a type assertion.\n\nEquivalent to `{} as TMeta`, but reads as type-only at the call site and\navoids `@typescript-eslint/no-unnecessary-type-assertion` false positives\nwhen the meta type has only optional properties (where an auto-fix removing\nthe assertion would silently degrade the inferred meta type to `{}`).\n\nThe returned value is a phantom — it is ignored and stripped from the\ntable's registered features at runtime; only its type is used.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TMeta\n\n`TMeta` *extends* `object`\n\n## Returns\n\n`TMeta`\n\n## Example\n\n```\nimport { metaHelper, tableFeatures, rowSortingFeature } from '@tanstack/react-table'\nconst features = tableFeatures({\n  rowSortingFeature,\n  tableMeta: metaHelper<MyTableMeta>(),\n  columnMeta: metaHelper<MyColumnMeta>(),\n});\n```\n"}
